WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:07.629
I've got a voicemail for you today that I
suspect I will have viewers and listeners

00:00:07.629 --> 00:00:10.530
who will not like this voicemail.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:19.440
And it is a caller speaking some difficult
truths to a sliver or a slice of the left.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.050
Let's take a listen to it.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:25.420
Progressive media is really risking jumping
the shark right now.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.290
They're covering stories like the George Bush
story.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:35.519
And they seem to not understand that people
who do wrong things in the past can occasionally

00:00:35.519 --> 00:00:38.399
still be correct in statements they make.

00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:44.780
And they're also covering the story with Joe
Biden saying that we told you so Bernie Sanders

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.449
would be the president.

00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:48.059
No, he wouldn't.

00:00:48.059 --> 00:00:51.429
Bernie Sanders couldn't even win the Democratic
nomination.

00:00:51.429 --> 00:00:54.850
And it wasn't the DNC fault this time.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:58.659
The people did not like Bernie Sanders.

00:00:58.659 --> 00:01:00.769
They liked Joe by.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:01.769
Yeah.

00:01:01.769 --> 00:01:02.769
OK.

00:01:02.769 --> 00:01:05.720
So let's let's deal with that second issue
first.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:11.460
I've already discussed the Bernie Biden thing,
you know, to to assume that Bernie obviously

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.680
would defeat Trump in November.

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:19.470
But Biden won't ignores essentially all of
the facts that we have, including that Bernie

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:24.590
lost the Democratic primary by millions of
votes and that that number may climb as more

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:26.630
primaries are done via mail in ballot.

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:29.030
I don't think we need to address that again.

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:32.290
On the issue of the Bush story, what the caller
is referring to is that over the weekend,

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:36.930
George W. Bush put out a three minute video
where he says the Corona virus is serious.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.190
It's not the time for partisanship.

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:40.480
We need to come together, et cetera.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:43.360
It's a completely reasonable and accurate
message.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.770
It doesn't mean Bush was right to go into
Iraq.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:48.190
It doesn't mean Bush was right with the torture.

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:52.920
It doesn't mean anything about Bush other
than he was right about that.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.180
And he's more sensible than Trump on this
issue.

00:01:56.180 --> 00:02:01.350
And I covered this yesterday, and I had already
been getting attacked on Twitter for it over

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.350
the weekend.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:07.550
And I got attacked again for rehabilitating
the reputation of a war criminal.

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:10.099
ET cetera, et cetera.

00:02:10.099 --> 00:02:13.819
And what I've realized, if I've had it's sort
of an epiphany over the last 10 days.

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:17.180
And I'm going to tell you what it is right
now.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.180
We've got a couple of minutes here before
we wrap the show.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.940
So I'll tell you what it is.

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:28.249
I always tended to just do the show the way
I want to do it and do the stories I want

00:02:28.249 --> 00:02:30.490
to do and so on and so forth.

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:35.709
But every once in a while, a little bit of
calculation would enter in where I might say

00:02:35.709 --> 00:02:41.889
I need to moderate my language here or there
or whatever, because I risk getting a certain

00:02:41.889 --> 00:02:46.329
reaction from my audience, which I would seek
to to avoid.

00:02:46.329 --> 00:02:51.140
I'm not really paying any more attention to
that because no matter what I do, that backlash

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:52.140
is going to exist.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.200
In case in point, yesterday I literally said
during my segment about hate, George W. Bush

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.590
was right about this one thing.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:02:59.590
Right?

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:00.999
This should not be a partisan thing, the corona
virus.

00:03:00.999 --> 00:03:01.999
We've got to come together.

00:03:01.999 --> 00:03:03.819
Trump is wrong on it.

00:03:03.819 --> 00:03:05.680
I said twice in the segment.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.170
Bush is a war criminal.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:12.300
I called the statement a completely unremarkable,
milquetoast statement.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.670
And yet it still shows us how whacked Donald
Trump is on this and every other issue that

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:20.950
he can't even put out a normal statement one
time, which George W. Bush was able to do,

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:24.660
didn't matter, didn't call him a war criminal
twice in the segment.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:29.159
And people are saying, David, you are ignoring
the fact that this guy's a war criminal and

00:03:29.159 --> 00:03:31.109
real rehabilitating his image.

00:03:31.109 --> 00:03:35.219
I called him a war criminal twice during this
segment.

00:03:35.219 --> 00:03:40.830
So what I've clearly realized is when people
say, David, you should cover this or you shouldn't

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.840
cover that or here's the position, you have
to.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:48.920
It actually doesn't matter at all if people
have determined that I'm the enemy, if they

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:52.230
want to be mad at me, they're going to be
regardless of what I say.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:55.249
If I cover a story, if I don't cover it or
whatever.

00:03:55.249 --> 00:03:59.391
So if you see any change in the show over
the next couple of weeks, other than the fact

00:03:59.391 --> 00:04:03.200
that we've extended the show an additional
10 percent every day, the show is longer now,

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.200
which is beautiful.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.590
It's a fantastic thing.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.590
You will see that.

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:10.810
I will be paying even I was paying eight percent
attention before.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:16.239
Call it to what I expected the reactions to
be to how I take on issues that's going down

00:04:16.239 --> 00:04:17.239
to zero.

00:04:17.239 --> 00:04:18.239
Some people will like it.

00:04:18.239 --> 00:04:19.239
Some people will not.

00:04:19.239 --> 00:04:20.680
But alas, such as life.

